{"script":"wt_c2_05_1_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]太好了，谢谢你们！这些量暂时足够了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]感觉自己离菲莉娜小姐又近了一步……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]每次望见菲莉娜小姐的背影，我就有继续往前的动力。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]我希望能成为和她并肩作战的同伴，而不只是跟在身后的被保护者。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]而且强大对于契约者来说是必须的，对于处在深渊的人来说更是必须的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]所以！我要继续向前！继续变得更强！更强！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"变强，变强，我要变强！"}